  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and non-food items support to Gedeo and Guji Internally Displaced People (IDPs). And support to ICRC for Tigray response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Food and non-food items support to Gedeo and Guji Internally Displaced People (IDPs). And support to ICRC for Tigray response is a component of Building Resilience in Ethiopia (BRE) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,443,352. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services, Relief co-ordination and support services, Social Protection.</narrative>
  </description>
